WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.492
Yikes! Who are you?

2
00:00:09.493 --> 00:00:14.259
I'm a black widow spider.

3
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:18.998
Spiders have eight legs.

4
00:00:18.999 --> 00:00:21.813
Where do you live?

5
00:00:21.814 --> 00:00:27.661
Black widow spiders live all over the world.

6
00:00:27.662 --> 00:00:31.804
We like dark places.

7
00:00:31.805 --> 00:00:40.670
We often hide under rocks or in basements.

8
00:00:40.671 --> 00:00:44.485
I like your red markings.

9
00:00:44.486 --> 00:00:48.892
Only females have these markings.

10
00:00:48.893 --> 00:00:54.120
Our markings look like an hourglass.

11
00:00:54.121 --> 00:00:56.967
What do you eat?

12
00:00:56.968 --> 00:01:00.499
We eat bugs.

13
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:06.363
We like flies, beetles, and grasshoppers.

14
00:01:06.364 --> 00:01:09.419
How do you catch prey?

15
00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:14.245
We make webs.

16
00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:19.289
Then we wait for bugs to come by.

17
00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:24.342
The bugs get caught in our webs.

18
00:01:24.343 --> 00:01:27.019
How do you make a web?

19
00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:30.282
We use silk.

20
00:01:30.283 --> 00:01:34.626
Our bodies make the silk.

21
00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:39.802
The silk is very strong and sticky.

22
00:01:39.803 --> 00:01:42.965
You're dangerous, right?

23
00:01:42.966 --> 00:01:47.431
We usually leave people alone.

24
00:01:47.432 --> 00:01:52.170
But we do bite.

25
00:01:52.171 --> 00:01:58.974
Our bites can make people very sick.

26
00:01:58.975 --> 00:02:04.396
Oh! I trapped a grasshopper in my web!

27
00:02:04.397 --> 00:02:06.705
Good-bye.

28
00:02:06.706 --> 00:02:15.734
Good-bye, Black Widow Spider!

